  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for UPC-E from PDF is a C# barcode scanner library to read, scan UPC-E barcode from PDF in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example C# source code to scan, read, decode UPC-E data message from PDF in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/csharp_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
